		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Colossal scarlet blob that shudders and drips a blood- like slime. Insatiable hunger, grows ever larger as it eats.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 8, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tentacle +6 (2d6 + dissolve), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dissolve</strong>. 1d4 CON damage, grows larger. When a blob has dealt 10 CON damage, split into two blobs, each with same remaining HP as original.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to acid, fire, electricity.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
